cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "CWFC — Compression as Conditional Optimal Transport"
authors:
  - family-names: Tran
    given-names: Khoi
    email: khoiminhtran68@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-11
url: "https://github.com/KhoiTrant68/cwfc"
abstract: >-
  De-risk experiments for learned image compression framed as conditional
  optimal transport. The central result is a negative/positive pair: an aggregate
  extended-cost OT objective cannot steer the conditional p(x|y_hat) with its
  cost-mixing knob (G1), whereas a conditional rectified-flow objective can (G4).
keywords:
  - optimal transport
  - learned image compression
  - distortion-perception trade-off
  - rectified flow
